# Primary repo

Assume code changes belong in **`book-of-heaven-anythingllm`** unless the user names another repo (e.g. `book-of-heaven`, splitters).

When mirroring fixes across repos, still apply edits in **`c:\Code\book-of-heaven-anythingllm`** first (or exclusively) unless explicitly asked to sync the other codebase.
